<title>PHILIPPINES: BOXING-ESPINOSA RETAINS WBC FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-ESPINOSA RETAINS WBC FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luisito Espinosa of the Philippines retained his World Boxing Council (WBC) featherweight title on Saturday when the referee stopped his bout with Mexican challenger Manuel Medina in the eighth round after the champion suffered a cut eye after a clash of heads.</p>
<p>Espinosa was leading on points when the contest was halted.</p>
</text>
